<title>THAILAND: Thai central bank sets baht reference at 28.922/dl.</title>
<headline>Thai central bank sets baht reference at 28.922/dl.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Thailand on Tuesday set the weighted average interbank exchange rate 28.922 to the dollar against 28.578 on Monday.  </p>
<p>The reference rate is announced daily by the central bank after last week's managed flotation of the baht.</p>
<p>The daily reference rate is based on the baht's traded average on the previous business day.</p>
<p>The baht was trading at 28.550/28.750 to the dollar in the offshore market and 29.000/29.100 in the local market after the rate was issued.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
